        "norm": "About 100-120 degrees at thighs-parallel; wide-stance loaded 3RM back squats reached about 119-120 degrees (Larsen 2021); bodyweight target at or slightly above that depth (clinical opinion)",
        "sources": [
          "larsen2021",
          "sinclair2022sports"
